	optdepends = python: run the Python and C recording and replay harnesses
	optdepends = gcc: compile C originals for recording
	optdepends = go: record Go behavior
	optdepends = ruby: record Ruby behavior
	optdepends = java-environment: provide javac and java for the Java harness
